Persist supervisor action continuity

Supervisor check-ins lost the last committed action when a parent
session unloaded because the context lived only in process memory.

Store the action and its timestamp in Saffron’s auxiliary database.
Scope persisted state to the goal, clear it when the goal changes or
ends, and restore it at the existing continuity boundary. Preserve
snooze delay and reason so a reconstructed supervisor can evaluate the
preceding external wait.
